  "description": "The META POWER SX 400 SIGNATURE Eagle 90 is the ideal bike for tackling steep terrain. Equipped with a robust T-Type drivetrain, your potential is unlocked.\n• FOX 38 Factory fork with Kashima stanchions: precise and dynamic with the new Grip X2 cartridge and Float X Factory shock for optimal grip and comfort.\n• Braking comes in the form of the TRP DH-R EVO PRO. Born from DH; the rider can brake later and still maintain full control.\n• Hand-built DT SWISS HFR 1700 wheels raise the bar for reliability. Paired with DT 350 hubs, the rolling gear is ready for anything.\n• The new SRAM Eagle 90 drivetrain features the tough and reliable T-Type system. It is super versatile with a 520% gear range.",
